# UI / shop

- Theme colors live in `CozyUiTheme`; do not invent a second palette
- Rebuild HUD with `CozyHudBuilder` — menu `PolyPets/UI/Apply Cozy Companion HUD`
- Shop panel is `FoodShopPanel` under the canvas; wire via `CareHudController.shopPanel`
- Dock actions are `UiChromeButton` with `UiButtonId` Feed / Play / Shop — persist with `SerializedObject`
- `ResolveMissingRefs()` is a runtime safety net, not a substitute for scene serialization
- Cozy sprites: `Assets/Art/UI/Cozy/` — generated by `EnsureCozySpritesOnDisk`
- Prefer soft parchment chips + bottom action dock; avoid dark “formal game” chrome
